- {{next_step_from_active_task}} = first stage with status != done's `done_when` (one sentence)
- {{today}}               UTC date YYYY-MM-DD
- {{project.slug}}        derived from the parent path <team>/projects/<slug>/
- {{plan_yml_path}}       absolute path to plan.yml
- {{active_task_yml_path}} absolute path to active task.yml
- Empty sections (no open_questions, no references) render as _(none)_
